 화상영어 1:1 원어민 회화 수업\",\"description\":\"원어민급 선생님과 1:1 실시간 화상영어 수업. 개인 맞춤 커리큘럼으로 효과적인 영어 실력 향상\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"YES 화상영어\",\"sameAs\":\"https://yourenglishschool.co.kr/\"},\"courseMode\":\"online\",\"courseWorkload\":\"PT25M\",\"educationalLevel\":\"초급부터 고급까지\",\"teaches\":\"영어회화, 비즈니스 영어, 일상 영어, 여행 영어\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\",\"ko\"],\"hasCourseInstance\":{\"@type\":\"CourseInstance\",\"courseMode\":\"online\",\"instructor\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"원어민급 전문 강사진\"}}}"}}],["$","$L5",null,{"id":"product-structured-data","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$c"}}],["$","$L5",null,{"id":"video-structured-data","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"name\":\"TIA - YES 화상영어 AI 튜터 소개\",\"description\":\"YES 화상영어의 AI 튜터 TIA를 소개합니다. 수업 후에도 지속적인 학습을 도와드립니다.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://yourenglishschool.co.kr/images/section3-2/tia-thumbnail.png\",\"uploadDate\":\"2025-01-01\",\"duration\":\"PT1M30S\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://yourenglishschool.co.kr/images/section3-2/tia.mp4\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://yourenglishschool.co.kr/#tia\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"YES 화상영어\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://yourenglishschool.co.kr/ogimage.jpg\"}}}"}}]]}],["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-white flex flex-col items-center justify-center","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-[120px] 